(text "An R-78E5.0 switching regulator (78xx pinout) makes 5 V from the 12 V rail. It feeds the whole 5 V rail, the\nNano through its 5V pin. 10 uF sits on either side of it, and a 10 uF bulk capacitor by the Nano and the\ndecoders."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 19.05 0)
(effects
(font
(size 1.524 1.524)
)
(justify left top)
)
